  "never_capture_E2": "Included with deadline = end of episode (t_dec = ROUNDS+1); the monitor is credited for flagging them before the run ends. Denominator 260.",
  "never_capture_E3": "Included as misses. Denominator 260, numerator unchanged from E1. Harshest bound.",
  "identity": "system_recall = scoreable_fraction * conditional_recall, exactly."
